[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_s")
id = "arcane"
display_name = "The Disciplines"
title = "The Disciplines"
category = "Fighting"
order = 43
image = "res://art/guide/arcane.png"
body = "The Disciplines are four arms of one tree - Blood, Holy, Berserk and the Arcane - kept on your account and learned in the Hold, or at the Hero Mansion on the road. Blood, Holy and Berserk fight up close; the Arcane fights from where it is standing, on mana rather than blood, and opens once the first act's boss has fallen.

Each arm is five clusters - Basic, Core, Guard, Ultimate and its Oath - and points spent in an arm open its deeper clusters. A skill is three nodes: the skill, an enhancement that hangs off it, and two forks off the enhancement, of which you may hold one. Passives take ranks. Skill points come from levels and from each act boss's first fall on each difficulty; letting nodes go is free, in the Hold, between roads.

An Oath is an arm's key passive: a boon paid for with a bane, one sworn at a time - two, for a Warden who has beaten the Gatekeeper.

The Arcane's skills are the ranged spells: Ember Fall and Stonefall drop where you pointed a moment ago, Frost Lance and Sky Lance flash along your aim, and Thorn Volley scatters over a patch of road. Focus pays for all of it: a deeper pool, a faster refill, sharper spells and shorter cooldowns."
